  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "AI Agent 长任务为什么容易跑偏？答案就藏在每次交接里。",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 4.728,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.171,
      "spokenEnd": 4.087,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Anthropic 用长周期编程任务研究过这个难题。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.648,
      "audioStart": 4.08,
      "spokenStart": 4.247,
      "spokenEnd": 7.097,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它给出的实用方向是：别让新会话先猜项目发生过什么。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.44,
      "audioStart": 7.037,
      "spokenStart": 7.197,
      "spokenEnd": 10.833,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "没有清晰底座，智能体会重复已完成的工作，或把半成品误认为完成。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.136,
      "audioStart": 10.833,
      "spokenStart": 10.993,
      "spokenEnd": 15.327,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "时间和风险都会被悄悄放大。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.784,
      "audioStart": 15.268,
      "spokenStart": 15.427,
      "spokenEnd": 17.41,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这期的可复用产物是 AI Agent 长任务进度与交接模板。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.416,
      "audioStart": 17.412,
      "spokenStart": 17.57,
      "spokenEnd": 21.186,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它把“继续做”变成一个可检查的小步骤。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.192,
      "audioStart": 21.119,
      "spokenStart": 21.286,
      "spokenEnd": 23.668,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "我们会依次拆开重启难题、工作底座、下一步粒度、交接内容和验收证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.736,
      "audioStart": 23.664,
      "spokenStart": 23.828,
      "spokenEnd": 28.766,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这样每次重启后的进度也能快速复核。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.384,
      "audioStart": 28.706,
      "spokenStart": 28.866,
      "spokenEnd": 31.449,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "视频全程干货高价值，让你成为更擅长使用 AI 的人，内容较长，点点关注收藏不迷路。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.576,
      "audioStart": 31.452,
      "spokenStart": 31.609,
      "spokenEnd": 37.381,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "长任务并不会因为智能体循环运行就天然连续。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 4.008,
      "audioStart": 37.403,
      "spokenStart": 37.561,
      "spokenEnd": 40.771,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "每个上下文窗口都可能像一次新的交接班。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.456,
      "audioStart": 40.708,
      "spokenStart": 40.871,
      "spokenEnd": 43.512,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u03",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "每次重启都要先定位现在的真实状态。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.312,
      "audioStart": 43.448,
      "spokenStart": 43.612,
      "spokenEnd": 46.12,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这会带来两种常见失败：一次想做太多，或看到部分成果就宣称全任务完成。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.216,
      "audioStart": 46.121,
      "spokenStart": 46.28,
      "spokenEnd": 51.707,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这两种失败都会让交接成本不断累积。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.216,
      "audioStart": 51.645,
      "spokenStart": 51.807,
      "spokenEnd": 54.218,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "上下文压缩能保留一些信息，但不能替代可查的工作状态。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.608,
      "audioStart": 54.221,
      "spokenStart": 54.378,
      "spokenEnd": 58.187,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "新会话仍要知道现在最重要的是什么。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.096,
      "audioStart": 58.125,
      "spokenStart": 58.287,
      "spokenEnd": 60.575,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "交接不是流水账，而是接口。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.616,
      "audioStart": 60.587,
      "spokenStart": 60.735,
      "spokenEnd": 62.573,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它要让下一位智能体不用重读全部历史也能选对下一步。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.344,
      "audioStart": 62.512,
      "spokenStart": 62.673,
      "spokenEnd": 66.204,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "真正该问的不是“之前聊了什么”，而是“环境现在有什么证据，还缺什么，下一步做什么”。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.288,
      "audioStart": 66.197,
      "spokenStart": 66.364,
      "spokenEnd": 71.842,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "把小型事实源放在上下文窗口之外，重启才不会靠猜。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.44,
      "audioStart": 71.84,
      "spokenStart": 72.002,
      "spokenEnd": 75.649,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 75.655,
      "spokenStart": 75.809,
      "spokenEnd": 76.482,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，窗口重启会丢失可用工作状态。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.216,
      "audioStart": 76.422,
      "spokenStart": 76.582,
      "spokenEnd": 79.01,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，半成品容易导致重复劳动或过早宣称完成。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.152,
      "audioStart": 79.01,
      "spokenStart": 79.17,
      "spokenEnd": 82.519,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，下一轮需要行动状态，而不是完整聊天记录。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.128,
      "audioStart": 82.521,
      "spokenStart": 82.679,
      "spokenEnd": 86.004,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "让 AI Agent 开始前，先建立工作底座。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 3.408,
      "audioStart": 86.022,
      "spokenStart": 86.184,
      "spokenEnd": 88.786,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它是新工作可以安全继续的最小已验证状态。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.624,
      "audioStart": 88.727,
      "spokenStart": 88.886,
      "spokenEnd": 91.724,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "在软件任务里，底座通常包括可运行环境、功能清单、进度记录和一次快速端到端检查。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.744,
      "audioStart": 91.736,
      "spokenStart": 91.884,
      "spokenEnd": 97.858,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "别的工作也要有等价锚点，让后续会话不必重复寻找这些信息。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.824,
      "audioStart": 97.801,
      "spokenStart": 97.958,
      "spokenEnd": 101.99,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "初始化智能体的职责不同：它要为后续会话铺路，减少每次都靠推测找方向。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.928,
      "audioStart": 101.988,
      "spokenStart": 102.15,
      "spokenEnd": 107.267,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "需求要放进能看出完成状态的结构里。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.168,
      "audioStart": 107.272,
      "spokenStart": 107.427,
      "spokenEnd": 109.803,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "不是写着“完成”就算完成，而是可观察行为真的通过。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.104,
      "audioStart": 109.748,
      "spokenStart": 109.903,
      "spokenEnd": 113.213,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "同时记录约束：允许的输入、不能碰的边界、已知失败和审阅者需要的证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.808,
      "audioStart": 113.21,
      "spokenStart": 113.373,
      "spokenEnd": 118.384,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "稳定底座能减少每一轮重新修地基的冲动，也让下一次检查更快开始。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.352,
      "audioStart": 118.377,
      "spokenStart": 118.544,
      "spokenEnd": 123.08,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 123.086,
      "spokenStart": 123.24,
      "spokenEnd": 123.917,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，先建立最小可验证的工作底座。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.144,
      "audioStart": 123.857,
      "spokenStart": 124.017,
      "spokenEnd": 126.359,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，让需求与约束可以快速检查。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.12,
      "audioStart": 126.364,
      "spokenStart": 126.519,
      "spokenEnd": 128.84,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，初始化是为后续会话服务，不是一次性交付。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.176,
      "audioStart": 128.841,
      "spokenStart": 129,
      "spokenEnd": 132.373,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "有了底座后，把下一步缩小。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.592,
      "audioStart": 132.395,
      "spokenStart": 132.553,
      "spokenEnd": 134.348,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "长任务 AI Agent 每轮应完成一个有意义的小单元，不要试图一口吞完整项目。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.664,
      "audioStart": 134.284,
      "spokenStart": 134.448,
      "spokenEnd": 139.307,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u03",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "这样才能在有限窗口里保持判断质量。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.264,
      "audioStart": 139.247,
      "spokenStart": 139.407,
      "spokenEnd": 141.865,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "小单元要边界清楚：一个功能、一条可复现失败、一次数据核对，或一个可审阅决定。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.456,
      "audioStart": 141.87,
      "spokenStart": 142.025,
      "spokenEnd": 147.694,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它应当装得进本轮上下文。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.304,
      "audioStart": 147.636,
      "spokenStart": 147.794,
      "spokenEnd": 149.299,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u03",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "边界清楚，验收才不会漂移。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.712,
      "audioStart": 149.241,
      "spokenStart": 149.399,
      "spokenEnd": 151.319,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "小不等于没有结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.872,
      "audioStart": 151.319,
      "spokenStart": 151.479,
      "spokenEnd": 152.545,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "智能体要改变真实状态，跑相关检查，并说明检查证明了什么、没有证明什么。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.192,
      "audioStart": 152.482,
      "spokenStart": 152.645,
      "spokenEnd": 158.052,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这样做不是故意变慢，而是避免半截实现留下昂贵的恢复成本。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.944,
      "audioStart": 158.051,
      "spokenStart": 158.212,
      "spokenEnd": 162.363,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "任务过大时，按用户能观察到的结果拆分，不要只按文件或 token 数量拆。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.76,
      "audioStart": 162.364,
      "spokenStart": 162.523,
      "spokenEnd": 167.471,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "进度模板要写清下一步、成功信号和停止条件。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.152,
      "audioStart": 167.479,
      "spokenStart": 167.631,
      "spokenEnd": 170.989,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 170.995,
      "spokenStart": 171.149,
      "spokenEnd": 171.822,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，每轮只领取一个有边界的目标。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3,
      "audioStart": 171.766,
      "spokenStart": 171.922,
      "spokenEnd": 174.148,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，目标必须绑定真实成功信号。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.096,
      "audioStart": 174.153,
      "spokenStart": 174.308,
      "spokenEnd": 176.6,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，按可观察结果拆分过大的任务。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.264,
      "audioStart": 176.605,
      "spokenStart": 176.76,
      "spokenEnd": 179.22,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "一份可用交接要快速回答四件事：改了什么、验证了什么、哪里未知、下一步最安全的动作是什么。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 7.416,
      "audioStart": 179.237,
      "spokenStart": 179.4,
      "spokenEnd": 186.007,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "四项缺一项，下一轮就容易靠猜。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.928,
      "audioStart": 185.952,
      "spokenStart": 186.107,
      "spokenEnd": 188.251,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "把决定和证据写在一起。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.28,
      "audioStart": 188.248,
      "spokenStart": 188.411,
      "spokenEnd": 189.876,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "“选 B”不够；",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 1.44,
      "audioStart": 189.821,
      "spokenStart": 189.976,
      "spokenEnd": 190.619,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u03",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "“B 通过了这个浏览器检查，而 A 在此处失败”才可复用。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.224,
      "audioStart": 190.555,
      "spokenStart": 190.719,
      "spokenEnd": 194.139,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u04",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 3,
      "text": "证据越靠近决定，交接越可靠。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.928,
      "audioStart": 194.073,
      "spokenStart": 194.239,
      "spokenEnd": 196.358,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "留下事实源入口，不要复制一整面上下文。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.504,
      "audioStart": 196.354,
      "spokenStart": 196.518,
      "spokenEnd": 199.205,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "下一轮按需打开功能清单、进度记录、测试或产物。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.392,
      "audioStart": 199.147,
      "spokenStart": 199.305,
      "spokenEnd": 202.892,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "环境要干净到另一个人或智能体能马上开始。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.72,
      "audioStart": 202.871,
      "spokenStart": 203.052,
      "spokenEnd": 205.953,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "存在隐藏破损的改动不能算有效进展。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.216,
      "audioStart": 205.903,
      "spokenStart": 206.053,
      "spokenEnd": 208.468,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "交接也要说清边界：不能修改哪个集成、不能宣称哪个指标，或必须等待哪项外部批准。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.504,
      "audioStart": 208.473,
      "spokenStart": 208.628,
      "spokenEnd": 214.326,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "边界让人类仍然掌握关键判断，即使智能体继续执行。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.536,
      "audioStart": 214.326,
      "spokenStart": 214.486,
      "spokenEnd": 218.223,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 218.229,
      "spokenStart": 218.383,
      "spokenEnd": 219.056,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，交接写清变化、证据、未知和下一步。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.152,
      "audioStart": 219.002,
      "spokenStart": 219.156,
      "spokenEnd": 222.502,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，链接可检查事实源，不复制全部上下文。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.032,
      "audioStart": 222.508,
      "spokenStart": 222.662,
      "spokenEnd": 225.908,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，把不能越过的边界写明白。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.76,
      "audioStart": 225.91,
      "spokenStart": 226.068,
      "spokenEnd": 228.033,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "AI Agent 想把进度标成完成前，要按用户真正感受到的层级验收。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.112,
      "audioStart": 228.045,
      "spokenStart": 228.213,
      "spokenEnd": 232.517,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "单元测试通过，不代表端到端功能可用。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.24,
      "audioStart": 232.457,
      "spokenStart": 232.617,
      "spokenEnd": 235.046,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u03",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "验收层级越接近用户，错误越早暴露。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.24,
      "audioStart": 234.983,
      "spokenStart": 235.146,
      "spokenEnd": 237.575,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "原文在网页应用实验中发现，明确要求智能体使用浏览器自动化做端到端检查后，结果更好。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.888,
      "audioStart": 237.576,
      "spokenStart": 237.735,
      "spokenEnd": 243.822,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "先跑最窄且足够的检查；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.376,
      "audioStart": 243.819,
      "spokenStart": 243.982,
      "spokenEnd": 245.555,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "如果影响界面、集成或交付，再补一条真实工作流检查。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.416,
      "audioStart": 245.496,
      "spokenStart": 245.655,
      "spokenEnd": 249.273,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "有证据后再更新进度卡。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.376,
      "audioStart": 249.275,
      "spokenStart": 249.433,
      "spokenEnd": 251.018,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "通过标记是验收的结果，不能代替验收。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.264,
      "audioStart": 250.961,
      "spokenStart": 251.118,
      "spokenEnd": 253.592,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "检查失败时，保留失败现象、复现路径和最小诊断动作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.848,
      "audioStart": 253.6,
      "spokenStart": 253.752,
      "spokenEnd": 257.816,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这样下一轮才能聚焦继续。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.28,
      "audioStart": 257.755,
      "spokenStart": 257.916,
      "spokenEnd": 259.398,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u03",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "不要把失败藏进一句模糊的待处理。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.712,
      "audioStart": 259.336,
      "spokenStart": 259.498,
      "spokenEnd": 261.403,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这也是人的关口：由人判断当前证据是否匹配这项决定的后果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.944,
      "audioStart": 261.402,
      "spokenStart": 261.563,
      "spokenEnd": 265.719,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.464,
      "audioStart": 265.725,
      "spokenStart": 265.879,
      "spokenEnd": 266.55,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，按用户可感知的结果验收。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.856,
      "audioStart": 266.491,
      "spokenStart": 266.65,
      "spokenEnd": 268.726,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，有证据后才把任务改为完成。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.144,
      "audioStart": 268.73,
      "spokenStart": 268.886,
      "spokenEnd": 271.229,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，把失败变成明确的下一步诊断。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.12,
      "audioStart": 271.225,
      "spokenStart": 271.389,
      "spokenEnd": 273.703,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "长任务 AI Agent 的连续性，需要被设计出来。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 3.576,
      "audioStart": 273.722,
      "spokenStart": 273.883,
      "spokenEnd": 276.658,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第一，先建立可运行、需求明确、能快速自检的工作底座。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.632,
      "audioStart": 276.657,
      "spokenStart": 276.818,
      "spokenEnd": 280.663,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，每轮完成一个小而可验证的结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.168,
      "audioStart": 280.666,
      "spokenStart": 280.823,
      "spokenEnd": 283.209,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，交接留下变化、证据、未知、边界和下一步。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.728,
      "audioStart": 283.209,
      "spokenStart": 283.369,
      "spokenEnd": 287.292,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p05-u01",
